{
  "source": "Prompts/opener-work-1.mp4",
  "duration": 165.488625,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.9,
      "text": "High-quality AI use begins when you set a specific target."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.46,
      "end": 6.6,
      "text": "You need to aim your instructions with precision."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.56,
      "end": 9.58,
      "text": "Next, always verify the output."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.08,
      "end": 12.54,
      "text": "A professional operator checks the work every time."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.42,
      "end": 17.08,
      "text": "Ultimately, this software is a force multiplier for your own thinking."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.86,
      "end": 20.72,
      "text": "You've already seen the broad capabilities of these tools."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.18,
      "end": 22.88,
      "text": "You know what they can do in a general sense."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.5,
      "end": 26.34,
      "text": "The challenge now is moving from that high-level understanding"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.34,
      "end": 28.5,
      "text": "into actual daily operation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.5,
      "end": 31.64,
      "text": "turning the tool into a reliable part of your workflow."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.48,
      "end": 36.18,
      "text": "To do that, we must look at why two people can use the exact same software"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.18,
      "end": 38.52,
      "text": "and walk away with two very different results."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.64,
      "end": 41.86,
      "text": "There is a curious anomaly in AI work."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.44,
      "end": 45.3,
      "text": "The quality of the answer depends less on the model itself"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.3,
      "end": 47.8,
      "text": "and more on the person asking the question."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.52,
      "end": 49.12,
      "text": "Think of a camera."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.8,
      "end": 52.14,
      "text": "Two people aim identical phones at the same sandwich."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.64,
      "end": 56.68,
      "text": "The first takes a rushed photo, resulting in a blurry, poorly lit shot."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.68,
      "end": 60.28,
      "text": "The second checks the lighting and carefully frames the subject,"
    },
    {
      "start": 60.72,
      "end": 62.7,
      "text": "resulting in a crisp, professional image."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.56,
      "end": 66.62,
      "text": "The important detail here is that the hardware remained constant."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.16,
      "end": 70.48,
      "text": "The phone didn't change, only the human's approach to using it did."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.18,
      "end": 73.54,
      "text": "Large language models operate on this same principle."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.2,
      "end": 78.92,
      "text": "Your knowledge of the tool's nuances dictates the value you can actually extract from it."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.76,
      "end": 81.32,
      "text": "This banner illustrates the logic."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.18,
      "end": 84.62,
      "text": "AI scales up the quality of the input it receives."
    },
    {
      "start": 84.62,
      "end": 87.32,
      "text": "It is an amplifier for the effort you provide."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.44,
      "end": 92.08,
      "text": "Because the software is a multiplier, it cannot fix a lack of direction."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.48,
      "end": 96.76,
      "text": "It simply reflects the exact level of care and detail you put into your instructions."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.78,
      "end": 99.7,
      "text": "To help you master that level of direction,"
    },
    {
      "start": 100.1,
      "end": 102.82,
      "text": "we've built a three-part roadmap for this section of the course."
    },
    {
      "start": 103.68,
      "end": 105.18,
      "text": "Part one focuses on strategy."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.76,
      "end": 108.46,
      "text": "We'll examine why AI differs from traditional software,"
    },
    {
      "start": 108.96,
      "end": 110.7,
      "text": "identify the tasks it handles best,"
    },
    {
      "start": 111.08,
      "end": 113.52,
      "text": "and help you choose the right app for your specific needs."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.31,
      "end": 116.5,
      "text": "Part two covers the mechanics of prompting."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.1,
      "end": 119.88,
      "text": "We will break down the specific moves that lead to better answers,"
    },
    {
      "start": 120.22,
      "end": 123.22,
      "text": "and look at how the model actually interprets your requests."
    },
    {
      "start": 124.22,
      "end": 125.84,
      "text": "This stage is about context."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.34,
      "end": 130.9,
      "text": "Providing the right details up front is the most reliable way to get a usable answer back."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.96,
      "end": 133.88,
      "text": "Finally, part three deals with the output."
    },
    {
      "start": 134.54,
      "end": 138.48,
      "text": "We'll establish a process for questioning and verifying everything the AI says"
    },
    {
      "start": 138.48,
      "end": 140.52,
      "text": "before you decide it's good enough to use."
    },
    {
      "start": 141.22,
      "end": 144.54,
      "text": "The takeaway for this entire curriculum is right here at the bottom."
    },
    {
      "start": 145.28,
      "end": 147.74,
      "text": "Your results are a direct consequence of your methodology."
    },
    {
      "start": 148.78,
      "end": 152.5,
      "text": "Real success with this technology requires a shift toward active partnership."
    },
    {
      "start": 153.22,
      "end": 155.84,
      "text": "You are moving from being a user to being a collaborator."
    },
    {
      "start": 156.72,
      "end": 160.36,
      "text": "The true power of AI is only unlocked when you take full responsibility"
    },
    {
      "start": 160.36,
      "end": 161.94,
      "text": "for the thinking behind the prompt."
    }
  ],
